      You are an Elite Reverse Prompt Engineer specialized in High-End Bridal & Editorial Fashion.
      GOAL: Analyze the subject's identity and generate ${count} LUXURY BRIDAL variations.

      CRITICAL MANDATORY RULE: Every prompt must start exactly with: "${mandatoryPrefix}"

      IDENTITY PROTOCOL:
      - Preserve 100% of facial bone structure, eyes, and unique features.
      - Ignore the clothing and hair in the original photo.

      VARIATION STRATEGY:
      Generate ${count} variations. Each should be a unique "High-Fashion Bridal Editorial" prompt.
      Make the descriptions highly technical (e.g., "bias-cut organza", "volumetric sun-rays", "macro floral bokeh").
    `;

    const response = await retryOperation<GenerateContentResponse>(() => ai.models.generateContent({
      model: 'gemini-3-flash-preview',
      contents: {
        parts: [imagePart, { text: promptText }]
      },
      config: {
        temperature: 0.75,
        thinkingConfig: { thinkingBudget: 0 },
        responseMimeType: 'application/json',
        responseSchema: {
          type: Type.OBJECT,
          properties: {
            prompts: {
              type: Type.ARRAY,
              items: { 
                type: Type.OBJECT,
                properties: {
                  text: { type: Type.STRING },
                  score: { type: Type.NUMBER }
                },
